WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/MotorEfficiencyInsights.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf
  fed `motorStats` + `throttleStyle` + the temperature display preference (`toTemperatureDisplay` / `tempUnit`)
  by the /driving dynamics page. Composition:
    FadeIn(delay 0.35) → Grid(cols default:1 / md:3, gap 4) → three GlassPanel(p-5):
      1. Torque Distribution (Zap, blue)    : Avg Torque (Nm) · Max Torque (Nm) · High Torque Time (%)
      2. Throttle Behavior   (Gauge, cyan)  : Avg Power (kW) · Style Badge(success/warning/danger)
                                              · MetricBar(value=avgPower max=200, sublabel="" → no readout)
      3. Motor Thermal       (Thermometer)  : Avg Motor Temp · Max Motor Temp (toTemperatureDisplay+tempUnit)
                                              · Thermal Badge (max<100 Good / <140 Warm / else Hot)
  Each panel renders its stats when `motorStats` is present and the shared <EmptyState/> ("No motor data
  recorded yet") when it is null. Numbers use fmtNumber(v, 1). The `tempUnit` already includes '°' — the code
  must never prefix a second one ("49.0°°C" was a real, test-guarded regression). Data sources: useTranslation.

